{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09352","headline":"秋景诣琅瑘精舍 · 韦应物","name":"秋景诣琅瑘精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"屡访尘外迹，未穷幽赏情。\n高秋天景远，始见山水清。\n上陟岩殿憩，暮看云壑平。\n苍茫寒色起，迢递晚钟鸣。\n意有清夜恋，身爲符守婴。\n悟言缁衣子，萧洒中林行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}